  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">선생님 PPT는 4차시 내용에 올린 것 앞부분 4차시 / 뒷부분 5차시로 사용했습니다!</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1번 2번 영상을 보고</span></p><p><b>오후 2시 45분에 ZOOM으로 접속!&#160;6교시 중간 시간입니다.</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>1,2번 영상 컴퓨터로는 한글 자막 자동 생성 가능합니다.</p><p>번역 글을 한글 첨부파일로 넣겠습니다.</p><p><b>1번 영상) 태양계의 생성</b></p><p><b><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IRZYMimUET8\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IRZYMimUET8</a>&#160;</b><b><br></b></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IRZYMimUET8\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/fd8NN/hyJbqHjiFH/89u55Vc3MDvLF3TvhCj1Jk/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IRZYMimUET8\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><b>2번 영상) 태양계의 가족들</b></p><p><b><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w36yxLgwUOc\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w36yxLgwUOc</a>&#160;</b><b><br></b></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w36yxLgwUOc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bqPdSo/hyJbpVUbDU/TyCEZCu3iKg1LjDjRIV3Zk/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/w36yxLgwUOc\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><b>3번 영상) 창백한 푸른 점: 칼 세이건&#160;[수업 마지막에 보는 영상]</b></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NkpmHPxn-h8\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NkpmHPxn-h8</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NkpmHPxn-h8\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/Z7hkY/hyJbq8lfYI/oNm8mRzveGEPC3fCKTP5Nk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NkpmHPxn-h8\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1763fe511646c145de9e946065d3544456bf4ec6?download\" data-file-name=\"태양계 영상 해석.hwp\" data-file-size=\"81920\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D239%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20210206202143&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1763fe511646c145de9e946065d3544456bf4ec6')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">태양계 영상 해석</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">80.00KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
